  "description": "Fuaran.Facts - the .NET reference implementation of the Fact wire specification: the Fact kernel's types, its canonical codec, the identity frame, supersession, as-of visibility, forecastness and freshness, and metric and subject definitions as data, with the specification's rendering standard and a reader for the legacy saved shape of stored facts. Certified against the specification's conformance corpus. FSharp.Core and Fuaran.Core only, Fable-clean.",
